<div class="bk-q bk-rv" style="--d:0ms">
<h3 class="bk-q-h"><button aria-controls="bk-a1" class="bk-q-btn o_no_wait_lazy_js" id="bk-q1" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-n">01</span><span class="bk-q-t">Do I need any previous experience with somatic practices?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-ic"/></button></h3>
<div aria-labelledby="bk-q1" class="bk-a" id="bk-a1" role="region"><div class="bk-a-in"><p>None at all. Every practice is designed to meet you where you are — no prior experience needed.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="bk-q bk-rv" style="--d:60ms">
<h3 class="bk-q-h"><button aria-controls="bk-a2" class="bk-q-btn o_no_wait_lazy_js" id="bk-q2" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-n">02</span><span class="bk-q-t">Do I need to talk about my trauma or past experiences?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-ic"/></button></h3>
<div aria-labelledby="bk-q2" class="bk-a" id="bk-a2" role="region"><div class="bk-a-in"><p>No. You never need to talk about what happened. The body releases in its own way — no narrative required.</p></div></div>
</div>
<div class="bk-q bk-rv" style="--d:120ms">
<h3 class="bk-q-h"><button aria-controls="bk-a3" class="bk-q-btn o_no_wait_lazy_js" id="bk-q3" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-n">03</span><span class="bk-q-t">How many sessions will I need?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-ic"/></button></h3>
<div aria-labelledby="bk-q3" class="bk-a" id="bk-a3" role="region"><div class="bk-a-in"><p>It varies. TRE™ is self-sufficient after 3–4 sessions. Coaching typically runs 6–12 sessions. Isabelle will be upfront about what she thinks you need.</p></div></div>
