<div class="bk-q bk-rv" style="--d:180ms">
<h3 class="bk-q-h"><button aria-controls="bk-a4" class="bk-q-btn o_no_wait_lazy_js" id="bk-q4" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-n">04</span><span class="bk-q-t">Can sessions be done online?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="bk-q-ic"/></button></h3>
<div aria-labelledby="bk-q4" class="bk-a" id="bk-a4" role="region"><div class="bk-a-in"><p>Yes. All sessions are available online via Zoom. In-person is available in Singapore and Japan.</p></div></div>
</div>
